<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Annonce indisponible</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: #0f1115;
            color: #f2f4f8;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
            body { background: #f5f6f8; color: #14161a; }
        }
        h1 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0 0 8px; }
        p { color: #9aa3b2; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div>
        <h1>Annonce indisponible</h1>
        <p>Cette annonce n'existe plus ou n'est pas encore active.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
